# T-HE-011 JSX closing-order bugfix — SettingsPage.tsx
#
# **CRITICAL BUG IN bcf44df0**: T-HE-011 work was committed with broken JSX structure
# in 2 places (Org tab + Pref tab). The `</div>` closing the grid wrapper was placed
# BEFORE the `</fieldset>` closing the fieldset, instead of AFTER. This causes tsc to
# report 14 errors and Apollo's post-push verify to fail.
#
# **ROOT CAUSE**: When the T-HE-011 work was committed in bcf44df0, the fieldset closing
# tags were inserted in the wrong order — `</div>` first, then `</fieldset>`. JSX requires
# nested elements to be closed in LIFO order (inner first, outer last). The fieldset is
# INSIDE the grid div, so the fieldset must close BEFORE the grid div.
#
# **FIX**: Swap the closing order so `</fieldset>` comes before `</div>` in both tabs.
# This is a 2-line swap in each of 2 locations (4 line changes total), with no semantic
# impact on the rendered UI.
#
# **VERIFICATION**:
# - tsc before fix: 14 errors (L73 cascade, L114/L182 unclosed fieldset, L173-176/L214-217 cascade, L323-325 trailing)
# - tsc after fix: 0 errors
# - git apply --check: PASS
# - Functional impact: ZERO (purely closing-order correction, no markup change)
#
# **ALSO**: The T-HE-011 patch file `docs/drafts/hera/settings-fieldset-aria-fixes.patch`
# (in HEAD bcf44df0) was generated against the pre-bcf44df0 state and represents the
# "broken" intermediate state. The pre-staged T-HE-011 docs (§11) and this bugfix patch
# together describe the FULL correct fix.
#
# **APPLY ORDER** (for any backport or re-application):
# 1. Apply T-HE-011 patch (`docs/drafts/hera/settings-fieldset-aria-fixes.patch`)
#    → fieldset/legend + aria-describedby + help text added
# 2. Apply THIS bugfix patch
#    → JSX closing order corrected (</fieldset> before </div>)
# 3. Verify: tsc=0, fieldset/legend renders correctly, aria-describedby resolves
#
# **CROSS-MUSE HANDOFFS**:
# - Apollo (post-push verify): Will fail tsc=0 on the unfixed bcf44df0; this bugfix must
#   be applied before push
# - Athena: Log this as a D-006 lesson — "fieldsets added in JSX need careful LIFO closing
#   order; verify with tsc=0 BEFORE commit, not after"
# - T-HE-011 spec doc: §11 D-009 reconciliation table updated to reflect bug found in
#   bcf44df0 post-commit
#
